## 📝 Simple To-Do List – Python

This project is a **command-line To-Do List application** developed using Python as part of my **Veda Technology Internship – Day 8 Task**.

### 🚀 Features

* Add new tasks
* View all tasks
* Update existing tasks
* Remove tasks
* Exit the application
* Handles invalid menu choices

### 🛠️ Concepts Used

* Python Lists
* Functions
* Loops
* Conditional statements
* CRUD operations

### 🎯 Objective

The main objective of this project is to understand the basics of **lists, loops, conditions, functions, and menu-driven programs** in Python.
